@startuml seq-prepare-attachment
' Context: media (sotto messaging)
' Profile: client
' Revision: 2026-07-27

title Media — preparazione allegato → invio messaging

participant "UI" as UI
participant "ChatInputBar" as BAR
participant "VoiceRecordingService" as VOICE
participant "MessageMediaService" as MEDIA
participant "MessagingCoordinator" as MSG

UI -> BAR : PrepareImage
BAR -> BAR : Preparing
alt formato / dimensione ok
  BAR -> MEDIA : uploadImage
  MEDIA --> BAR : AttachmentReady
  UI -> MSG : SendContent
  MSG --> UI : ContentSent
else rifiuto
  BAR --> UI : AttachmentRejected
end

note over BAR, MSG
  Voice / video / gif / location: stesso schema
  Prepare* → Preparing → AttachmentReady → SendContent (messaging).
  Contesto documented — nessuno statechart media dedicato.
end note

@enduml
